{"text": "Jour 3 : vous avez vot\u00e9\u2026 le commissariat ! Merci \u00e0 tous les habitants. Quinze cents euros plus tard, le commissariat de Petitbourg est construit ! Batchess en devient le chef. Les habitants dorment enfin en s\u00e9curit\u00e9. Louh devient polici\u00e8re, et Kenzo, sergent K9 avec son labrador beige. La police est au complet ! Une \u00e9quipe soud\u00e9e pour prot\u00e9ger le village. Ilyes accepte Matemat comme colocataire. Sa maison s'agrandit : deux habitants ! Premier colocataire de l'histoire de Petitbourg ! Dans la caisse : trois mille six cents euros d'imp\u00f4ts, moins quinze cents. Il reste deux mille cent euros. Partie 2 : la mosqu\u00e9e !", "timing": [41.560816, [0.0, 0.104, 0.174, 0.209, 0.244, 0.325, 0.476, 0.65, 0.766, 1.091, 1.126, 1.173, 1.207, 1.254, 1.3, 1.347, 1.382, 1.428, 1.451, 1.474, 1.509, 1.602, 1.695, 1.869, 2.067, 3.181, 3.228, 3.262, 3.309, 3.344, 3.402, 3.425, 3.46, 3.518, 3.553, 3.599, 3.692, 3.738, 3.808, 3.878, 3.901, 3.971, 4.087, 4.528, 4.586, 4.644, 4.702, 4.783, 4.83, 4.888, 4.911, 4.946, 4.981, 5.016, 5.039, 5.062, 5.085, 5.108, 5.155, 5.178, 5.213, 5.236, 5.259, 5.306, 5.387, 5.445, 5.515, 5.538, 5.573, 5.654, 5.724, 6.107, 6.177, 6.211, 6.269, 6.351, 6.397, 6.444, 6.478, 6.513, 6.583, 6.606, 6.629, 6.664, 6.711, 6.734, 6.757, 6.827, 6.861, 6.885, 6.908, 6.943, 6.989, 7.024, 7.047, 7.07, 7.129, 7.221, 7.268, 7.384, 7.5, 7.651, 7.697, 7.732, 7.779, 7.814, 7.86, 7.883, 7.918, 7.976, 7.999, 8.046, 8.104, 8.127, 8.185, 8.22, 8.243, 8.266, 8.29, 8.324, 8.371, 8.406, 8.475, 8.522, 8.568, 8.603, 8.661, 8.719, 8.754, 8.789, 8.812, 8.87, 8.94, 8.963, 8.986, 9.033, 9.079, 9.149, 9.195, 9.253, 9.3, 9.358, 9.404, 9.451, 9.474, 9.543, 9.625, 10.136, 10.194, 10.286, 10.333, 10.379, 10.414, 10.507, 10.542, 10.612, 10.658, 10.728, 10.751, 10.797, 10.82, 10.89, 10.937, 10.995, 11.041, 11.064, 11.111, 11.18, 11.238, 11.308, 11.343, 11.389, 11.424, 11.54, 11.656, 11.807, 12.249, 12.307, 12.365, 12.388, 12.446, 12.469, 12